      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِئْشَارٌ</span></b>  (S, Msb, K, &amp;c.) [<i>A saw;] an instrument with which wood is divided;</i> (Msb, K) as
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِيشَارٌ</span>, from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَشَرَ</span>; (Msb, TA;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْشَارٌ</span>:
(TA:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَآشِيرُ</span>. (ISk, Msb, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also
this word and its dual voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آشِرٌ</span>.

